  {% comment %} ---------- 2. What is kratom ---------- {% endcomment %}
  <section class="belowfold belowfold--rule" aria-labelledby="d2-kratom-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="kcard" data-copy-status="aggressive-draft">
      <h2 class="kcard__title" id="d2-kratom-{{ section.id }}">OK, but what is kratom?</h2>
      <p class="kcard__lead">Kratom comes from the leaves of Mitragyna speciosa, a tall evergreen in the coffee family that grows across Southeast Asia. For thousands of years, people in Thailand, Malaysia, and Indonesia have brewed and chewed the leaf for a steady lift through long days of work and warm evenings after. Dandy takes that same leaf and portions it into a gummy with exactly 35 mg of mitragynine, so you know what you’re getting every time. Everyone feels it a little differently, which is why we say start with one.</p>
      <div class="kcard__row">
        <div class="kcard__facts">
          <div class="kcard__chips">
            <span class="kchip">{{ d2_gcheck }}Coffee-family botanical</span>
            <span class="kchip">{{ d2_gcheck }}Thousands of years of use</span>
            <span class="kchip">{{ d2_gcheck }}Independently lab tested</span>
          </div>
          <p class="kcard__more"><a href="{{ url_kratom }}">The full kratom guide →</a></p>
