  {% comment %} ---------- 6. FAQ ---------- {% endcomment %}
  <section class="belowfold belowfold--rule" aria-labelledby="d2-faq-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="belowfold__inner belowfold__inner--narrow">
      <p class="steplabel">Straight answers</p>
      <h2 class="belowfold__title" id="d2-faq-{{ section.id }}">The questions people actually ask.</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>Is kratom legal?</summary><p>Kratom is legal in 32 states. We don’t ship to the other 18, <a href="{{ url_ship }}">here’s the list</a>, and checkout checks your address before you pay.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will I feel weird?</summary><p data-copy-status="pending-legal">Most people don’t. Start with half a gummy and give it about 45 minutes. What people usually describe is warm, upbeat, social, and focused, closer to a really good morning than anything strange. Everyone’s a little different, so ease in and find your amount.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will I fail a drug test?</summary><p>Kratom’s alkaloids aren’t screened on standard panels, but specialized tests exist. If testing matters in your life, we can’t promise a result. Nobody honestly can.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is it tested? What’s actually in it?</summary><p>Every batch goes to an independent lab for identity, mitragynine potency, heavy metals, and microbials, and every pouch carries its batch number. <a href="{{ url_coa }}">Read this batch’s report</a>.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Who shouldn’t take Dandy?</summary><p>Anyone under 21, anyone pregnant or nursing, and anyone on medication until they’ve talked with their doctor. Like anything that changes how you feel, kratom can become habit-forming, so use it with intention and take breaks. If you have any doubts, ask your doctor first. And we can’t ship to 18 states, <a href="{{ url_ship }}">check yours</a>.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I become dependent on kratom?</summary><p>With regular daily use, tolerance and habit can build. That’s real and it’s on our label. Our guidance is simple: start low, take breaks, and let the label set the cap.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How does the subscription work?</summary><p>$47.99 today and $47.99 every 30 days, with free shipping on every order. Skip, pause, or cancel anytime from your account or with one email.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if it’s not for me?</summary><p data-copy-status="pending-legal">Easy. Give it 30 days. If it isn’t for you, email <a href="mailto:support@foreverdandy.com">support@foreverdandy.com</a> and we’ll make it right. Fewer than 3% of customers have ever asked, but the door is always open.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% comment %} ---------- 7. Recap ---------- {% endcomment %}
  <section class="belowfold belowfold--finale" aria-labelledby="d2-recap-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="belowfold__inner belowfold__inner--narrow belowfold__inner--center">
      <p class="steplabel">Still here?</p>
